#ASSERT `reg 35(3A)(b) the extent of the enhanced customer due diligence measures is less than the extent for a non-domestic PEP` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `reg 35(3A)(b) the extent of the enhanced customer due diligence measures is less than the extent for a non-domestic PEP` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- (4)(a)
