#ASSERT `reg 35(4)(a) the relevant person must take account of the relevant information made available to it` (JUST TRUE) FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `reg 35(4)(a) the relevant person must take account of the relevant information made available to it` (JUST FALSE) TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- (4)(b) arguments: issued by the FCA; issued by any other supervisory authority or appropriate body; approved by the Treasury
#ASSERT `reg 35(4)(b) the relevant person may take into account the guidance` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `reg 35(4)(b) the relevant person may take into account the guidance` FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `reg 35(4)(b) the relevant person may take into account the guidance` FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `reg 35(4)(b) the relevant person may take into account the guidance` FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- (5) arguments: relevant person; business relationship (S-K1); proposes a business relationship with a PEP or relative or associate; requirement
#ASSERT `reg 35(5) the relevant person must meet the requirement, in addition to the measures required by regulation 33` (JUST TRUE) (JUST TRUE) TRUE `reg 35(5)(a) have approval from senior management for establishing or continuing the business relationship` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `reg 35(5) the relevant person must meet the requirement, in addition to the measures required by regulation 33` (JUST TRUE) (JUST FALSE) TRUE `reg 35(5)(b) take adequate measures to establish the source of wealth and source of funds` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `reg 35(5) the relevant person must meet the requirement, in addition to the measures required by regulation 33` (JUST TRUE) (JUST TRUE) TRUE `reg 35(5)(c) conduct enhanced ongoing monitoring of the business relationship` EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- (c) "where the business relationship is entered into": not entered into, no; not answered, nothing
#ASSERT `reg 35(5) the relevant person must meet the requirement, in addition to the measures required by regulation 33` (JUST TRUE) (JUST FALSE) TRUE `reg 35(5)(c) conduct enhanced ongoing monitoring of the business relationship` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `reg 35(5) the relevant person must meet the requirement, in addition to the measures required by regulation 33` (JUST TRUE) NOTHING TRUE `reg 35(5)(c) conduct enhanced ongoing monitoring of the business relationship` EQUALS NOTHING
-- the duty is of "a relevant person who proposes to have, or to continue, a business relationship with a PEP": otherwise nothing
