#ASSERT `reg 35(5) the relevant person must meet the requirement, in addition to the measures required by regulation 33` (JUST FALSE) (JUST TRUE) TRUE `reg 35(5)(a) have approval from senior management for establishing or continuing the business relationship` EQUALS NOTHING
