-- a PEP who ceased on 15 March 2020: at least 12 months after that date, i.e. to 15 March 2021 (fork F35-2: the anniversary is included)
#ASSERT `reg 35(9) the relevant person must continue to apply the requirements in paragraphs (5) and (8) on the date asked` (JUST TRUE) TRUE (Date 15 3 2020) NOTHING (Date 15 3 2021) EQUALS JUST TRUE
