#ASSERT `reg 35(9) the relevant person must continue to apply the requirements in paragraphs (5) and (8) on the date asked` (JUST TRUE) TRUE (Date 15 3 2020) (JUST (Date 15 3 2023)) (Date 15 3 2023) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `reg 35(9) the relevant person must continue to apply the requirements in paragraphs (5) and (8) on the date asked` (JUST TRUE) TRUE (Date 15 3 2020) (JUST (Date 15 3 2023)) (Date 16 3 2023) EQUALS JUST FALSE
